01:11:34.000 --> 01:11:39.000
he enabled police to swiftly identify Mark Twitchell as their prime suspect, ensuring he didn't have an opportunity to claim more victims. Detective Anstey told Johnny's mother, your son in a roundabout way was a hero. He definitely saved a lot of grief for other families. . There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
